MODULE: QuarantineIgnoresNewExpiry
TARGET: NoEarlyEscalation
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: a retired saga quarantines before its new deferral clock expires
PERTURBS: Escalate

--- FIND
           quarantine == expired /\ mode[r] = "retired" /\ space.quarantine
--- REPLACE
           quarantine == mode[r] = "retired" /\ space.quarantine
--- END
